 "remarks": "Welcome to this beautifully updated 2-bedroom corner-unit condo in a convenient Stamford location! This bright and inviting home features a beautifully updated, light-filled kitchen, hardwood floors throughout, and two assigned parking spaces-a rare and highly desirable convenience. The corner-unit layout provides added privacy and natural light, while the move-in-ready condition allows you to settle in immediately. Conveniently located near shopping, restaurants, public transportation, I-95, and major commuting routes, with easy access to everything Stamford has to offer. Whether you're looking for your next home or a solid investment opportunity, this property offers convenience, location, and value. Move right in and enjoy all that Stamford has to offer!",
